
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_FREE_EQUESTRIA_RESEARCH_GROUP]
Free Equestria Research Group

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_FREE_EQUESTRIA_RESEARCH_GROUP_desc]
South of the Rock Farm, Sunset Shimmer was leading her friends in resisting the Imperial forces.\nAt the same time, Sunset’s unusual and mysterious origins had placed Free Equestria’s scientific research far ahead of the rest of the world.\nIf we were to seek their help, perhaps they could make up for the Rock Farm’s shortcomings in that field.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_FREE_EQUESTRIA_RESEARCH_GROUP]
自由小马利亚科研团

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_FREE_EQUESTRIA_RESEARCH_GROUP_desc]
在采石农场的更南方，余晖烁烁正带领着她们的朋友共同抵抗着帝国势力，与此同时，余晖烁烁特别而神秘的来历让自由小马利亚的科研水平处于整个世界的领先水准，如果我们请求他们的帮助，或许可以弥补采石农场在这方面的空缺
